Third-party dependencies are resolved from pub.dev and are not vendored into this
repository. Their licenses apply as published. Principal dependencies:

  flutter                        UI framework
  hooks_riverpod, riverpod_annotation, flutter_hooks   state management
  graphql_flutter, gql           GraphQL client
  web3dart                       Ethereum client library
  reown_appkit                   wallet connection
  webview_flutter                embeds the chart from tokenzyme-app
  socket_io_client               WebSocket transport
  flutter_secure_storage, shared_preferences           local storage
  decimal, intl, timeago         formatting
  hugeicons                      icon set

Review each package's terms before redistributing a build that bundles them.
